<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nu Skin started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nu Skin started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Nu Skin Asia Pacific Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said new products, growth in Japan and Korea and entry into Thailand could permit earnings growth of 34 percent in 1997 and 20 percent in 1998.</p>
<p>-- sets 1997 earnings view at $1.25 a share.</p>
</text>
